<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/msa@/~cl_3__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/4/msa@> .
